# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Model weights — NOT tracked
#  Each checkpoint is ~327 MB (4 files, ~1.3 GB total), which exceeds
#  GitHub's file limit and would exhaust the Git LFS quota. They are
#  reproducible from the notebooks and are published as Kaggle notebook
#  outputs; see README.md → "Model weights".
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.pth
kaggle/**/ablation_vit_*.zip
kaggle/**/seed*_vit_*.pth

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Oversized intermediate output — NOT tracked
#  audit_near_duplicates.csv holds 676k dHash pairs (84 MB). It is
#  superseded: at 8x8 resolution the dHash threshold is far too permissive
#  for a domain as homogeneous as chest radiography (157k of those pairs
#  cross class boundaries, which is itself proof of false positives). The
#  leakage analysis reported in the paper uses exact source-filename
#  matching instead, which is in audit_files.csv.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
kaggle/**/audit_near_duplicates.csv

# ── Preprocessing caches (regenerated by the notebooks) ──────────────────
_ablation_cache/
_seed_cache/
*_quick/

# ── Third-party template archives (download from IEEE Author Center) ─────
JBHI_LaTex_Template.zip
JBHI_word_template.docx

# ── LaTeX build artefacts (paper/main.pdf is tracked on purpose) ─────────
*.aux
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.bbl
*.blg
*.brf
*.idx
*.ilg
*.ind

# LaTeX logs are ignored, but Kaggle run logs are evidence and are kept.
*.log
!kaggle/**/*.log

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ── Editors and operating systems ────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# ── Local backups ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git.backup-*/
*.ONCEKI.md
*.bak

# LaTeX epstopdf ara ciktisi
*-eps-converted-to.pdf
